  ('c2461930-b9cb-5261-a7b3-04b0e1bac1cf', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g10-narrative-writing'), null, 'hard',
   $q$The writer wants to add a line of dialogue after sentence 18 that reveals Lola's point of view. Which line does this best?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"I told you it was the same medicine,\" I said to Lola.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"narrator-pov-not-lola"},{"text":"\"Do you want a bag for that?\" the cashier asked us.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-detail"},{"text":"\"Now I can read it myself,\" Lola said quietly, patting her purse.","is_correct":true},{"text":"\"Next, please,\" Mr. Adeyemi called to the man in the work jacket.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-speaker"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"Now I can read it myself," Lola said quietly, patting her purse.$q$, $q$Lola's line shows that what she wanted was independence, which matches the narrator's realization in sentence 12. The narrator's line gives the narrator's view, not Lola's, and sounds impatient.$q$, 'draft', 'e040d615-d767-52eb-8ea7-9c51c889af55')
