   $q$What is the main purpose of sentence 9 in the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To introduce a new claim that volunteers are more important to the program than the building managers.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"To suggest that Moreno doubts whether the lights out program has actually helped any birds.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"To give a second example of how bright windows confuse birds that migrate at night.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"To show the counts were gathered the same way each time, so the drop can be trusted rather than blamed on a change in method.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To show the counts were gathered the same way each time, so the drop can be trusted rather than blamed on a change in method.$q$, $q$Sentence 9 explains that the method stayed the same, which strengthens the comparison in sentences 6 and 7. It introduces no new claim about volunteers, and nothing in it shows Moreno doubting the program.$q$, 'draft', 'be021c9d-19ba-5312-9674-c15646472be0')
