values
  ('cc61e715-d5e7-556d-908a-ce48428c98a1', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g11-argument-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$The writer wants to strengthen the response in sentence (11). Which addition provides the most relevant evidence?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Most teachers would probably get used to the new books eventually.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-speculation"},{"text":"Change can be hard for everyone, but it is simply a part of life.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-general"},{"text":"In a follow-up survey, 21 of the pilot's 24 teachers said they would choose the open texts again.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Teachers at Ridgeway work very hard and deserve the community's respect.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In a follow-up survey, 21 of the pilot's 24 teachers said they would choose the open texts again.$q$, $q$The survey result gives concrete evidence that teachers adapted and approved of the texts, which directly answers the concern in sentence (10). The guess that teachers "would probably" adjust offers no evidence at all.$q$, 'draft', '22a42c20-37e4-50da-bf6b-fa65ac05b899')
