  ('b2905412-23c3-5366-8403-031f718ac44c', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g11-informative-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$The writer wants to add a quotation from Amara Nwosu after sentence 10. Which quotation best develops the main idea of paragraph 3?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"Cold does not stop the chemistry,\" Nwosu explained, \"but it slows it enough to give us decades to copy each reel.\"","is_correct":true},{"text":"\"I started working at the archive twelve years ago,\" Nwosu said.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-quotation"},{"text":"\"Our building has a lovely lobby that visitors enjoy,\" Nwosu noted.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-focus-detail"},{"text":"\"Old films are the most treasured part of our culture,\" Nwosu said.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opinion-not-development"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"Cold does not stop the chemistry," Nwosu explained, "but it slows it enough to give us decades to copy each reel."$q$, $q$The correct quotation explains why cold storage works and links it to the copying described in paragraph 4. The quotation about culture expresses a value but does not develop the idea of cold storage.$q$, 'draft', 'f2f16490-877e-5795-bcc8-8881e3af32e0')
